### [ ] Task 9 — Write backend tests for `GET /api/data/tasks`

Create `autom9-backend/tests/api/test_data.py`:

```python
import pytest
from httpx import AsyncClient

pytestmark = pytest.mark.asyncio(loop_scope="session")

SESSION_HEADERS = {"X-Autom9-Session": "test-session-id"}


